+"ayu_IntelGramUpdateLogCurrent" = "**Liquid Glass & Motion**\n- Liquid Glass layers adaptive tint and contrast, wallpaper-aware diffusion, cursor-reactive specular light, refractive edges, internal reflections, and subtle film grain over native desktop blur.\n- Material animation follows the active display refresh rate up to 120 Hz and pauses while IntelGram is hidden, inactive, or respecting reduced-motion and power-saving settings.\n- Control sidebar, chat, menu, dialog, and panel transparency separately; choose a private local backdrop and tune image opacity, blur, tint, surface opacity, and optical intensity without fading text, icons, avatars, or media.\n- Quick Snap is compact and immediate. Smooth Flow is calm and critically damped. Diabolical is brisk with stronger depth. Springy settles gently. The optional Liquid Bounce pack adds the most elastic lift and a controlled overshoot.\n- Local channel showcase can display a selected public channel on your own IntelGram profile with a Local showcase label. It never claims ownership, joins the channel, changes permissions, or modifies Telegram.\n- The profile username editor matches Telegram's native title, @username field, validation row, help text, and button layout while saving only IntelGram's local render value.\n- Universal local full-text search covers messages, filenames, media types, and links already received by IntelGram, with a unified view across signed-in accounts.\n- Export Center creates chat or account HTML, PDF, Markdown, JSON, and ZIP archives. Frozen Account Backup streams the full set and permitted downloaded files into one AES-256-GCM encrypted archive without leaving plaintext exports behind.\n- Telegram's protected-content and self-destruct restrictions remain enforced throughout the vault, rules, exports, and legacy local save paths.";
+"ayu_IntelGramUpdateLogFeaturesTitle" = "Main IntelGram features";
+"ayu_IntelGramUpdateLogFeatures" = "**Local profile and collectibles**\n- Display name, UID, primary and other usernames, anonymous number, bio, profile photo, badges, emoji status, personal channel rendering, and a clearly labeled local public-channel showcase.\n- Local profile cloning from a user already visible to IntelGram, plus cached lookup by UID or a phone number visible to your account.\n- Native collectible collection galleries, one featured collectible, up to six pinned collectibles, and local owner/profile rendering.\n\n**Private productivity and customization**\n- Universal message vault, unified account inbox, timeline tools, edit/deletion history, smart folders, contact notes with reminders and history, identity inspector, local rules, anti-spam review, and per-chat controls.\n- Native themes, cloud theme browsing, chat wallpapers, adaptive Liquid Glass, native blur, five motion packs, icon swapping, and interface controls.\n- Local HTML, PDF, Markdown, JSON, ZIP, and encrypted Frozen Account Backup exports with permitted cached media.";
+"ayu_IntelGramUpdateLogPrivacyTitle" = "Local-only boundary";
+"ayu_IntelGramUpdateLogPrivacy" = "Local profile tools never update your Telegram profile, import contacts, claim channel ownership, change channel permissions, change collectible ownership, or join a channel automatically. The channel showcase uses only a public read-only lookup. Vault tools only process data already received by this client. Restrict Saving Content and self-destructing media are preserved: IntelGram stores a jump-back reference and basic metadata, never the protected body or media.";
